B.Wa=new A.c9("melee_ancient","Ancient","On Player Failure, Allies within {Level} have Resistance to attacks as if they had this unit's defenses. On Player Success, allies within 1 have Resistance to attacks as if they had this unit's defenses.",B.ci,B.dk)
B.W7=new A.c9("melee_berserker","Berserker","On Player Failure, Knock the target prone, deal {Level/3} d6 extra damage, and Until the start of their next turn, the chump has resistance to all damage.\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends its turn range 1, make a Berserker attack.",B.ci,B.dk)
B.VI=new A.c9("melee_challenger","Challenger","On Player Failure, the target cannot disengage and must include this unit as a target of all attacks or suffer disadvantage on their next turn. On Failure, Target a player that they can see and have them make a Wis defense, On Player Failure, they are challenged as if attacked.",B.ci,B.dk)
B.VK=new A.c9("melee_defender","Defender","On Player Failure, players have -1 to attacks against this chump and their adjacent allies until the start of their next turn. On Player Success, players have -1 to attack against this chump's allies who are range 1 of this defender.",B.ci,B.dk)
B.W4=new A.c9("melee_feasting","Feasting","On Player Failure, Heal half the damage they deal and knock the target prone. If the target dies or the first time they feast on a dead body, heal the full amount.\n[Reaction] When an enemy dies or is knocked prone within half speed, dash to a space adjacent to the target and make a Feasting Attack against the target or an enemy range 1.",B.ci,B.dk)
B.VO=new A.c9("melee_frozen","Frozen","On Player Failure, The target and enemies adjacent to either the target or you, gains {Level/3} Cold.\n[Reaction] When a Player Succeeds an attack against the chump and they resist the damage, give {Level/4} cold to enemies adjacent to the chump.",B.ci,B.dk)
B.VY=new A.c9("melee_guard","Guard","On Player Failure, During the target's next turn their speed is 0.\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts or becomes adjacent, make the guard attack, the effect applies to their current turn.",B.ci,B.dk)
B.VT=new A.c9("melee_paladin","Paladin","On Player Failure, heal an ally equal to half the damage dealt.\n[Reaction] During an adjacent ally's turn, you may reduce this chump's HP and give it to that ally.",B.ci,B.dk)
B.VR=new A.c9("melee_stampeding","Stampeding","Instead, Move up to half their speed, moving through enemies. Each target makes a Dex Defense, On Player Failure, they take {Damage} and are knocked prone.\n[Reaction] After a Player Succeeds an Attack against them, you may have them stamped.",B.ci,B.dk)
B.VG=new A.c9("melee_valorous","Valorous","On Player Failure, this chump resists all damage.\n[Reaction] When an ally range {Level} is successfully attacked and that attack didn't include this chump as a target, this chump takes the damage instead of the target. Effects still target the original character.",B.ci,B.dk)
B.dK=new A.kX(1,"controller")
B.Wb=new A.c9("melee_bully","Bully","On Player Failure, knock them prone.\n[Reaction] When an ally attacks a player in range, make the bully attack.",B.ci,B.dK)
B.VP=new A.c9("melee_grabber","Grabber","On Player Failure, the target is grappled.\n[Reaction] The first time each turn, a player starts their turn in range or enters range during any turn, making a grabbing attack.",B.ci,B.dK)
B.W2=new A.c9("melee_scoundrel","Scoundrel","On Player Failure, Half the targets speed and knock them prone.\n[Reaction] The first time an enemy starts or becomes range 3 during their turn, make a scoundrel attack against the target.",B.ci,B.dK)
B.VA=new A.c9("melee_toxic","Toxic","On Player Failure, The target gain {Level/3} d8 Burn vs Vit, While they have this burn, halve their speed.\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends in range 3 during their turn, make a toxic attack against the target.",B.ci,B.dK)
B.cJ=new A.kX(2,"killThreat")
B.VM=new A.c9("melee_striker","Striker","On Player success, deal half damage.\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends their turn in range, make an attack.",B.ci,B.cJ)
B.VX=new A.c9("melee_skirmisher","Skirmisher","Regardless of Success, after damage this unit dashes their speed.\n[Reaction] When a player first becomes adjacent during their turn, they must make a Wis defense or this unit dashes half their speed.",B.ci,B.cJ)
B.W_=new A.c9("melee_flurry","Flurry","Instead, target all adjacent enemies.\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends their turn in range, make a Flurry Attack.",B.ci,B.cJ)
B.VL=new A.c9("melee_bloody","Bloody","On Player Failure, the target gain {Half Level} d6 Bleed, and You may deal {Half Level d6} damage to the chump to give all enemies adjacent to the target or the chump {Half Level} d6 bleed.\n[Reaction] At the end of a turn, you may deal {Half Level d6} damage to the chump and give all enemies adjacent to them {Half Level} d6 Bleed.",B.ci,B.cJ)
B.Wl=new A.c9("melee_ignitor","Ignitor","On Player Failure, the target gain {Half Level} d6 Burn vs Dex.\n[Reaction] At the end of the round, give the chump and all characters range 3 of them {Level} d6 burn.",B.ci,B.cJ)
B.Wi=new A.c9("melee_parasite","Parasite","On Player Failure, instead give the target {Half Level} d6 Bleed then the chump attaches to the Target. While attached, players cannot target the chump and the chump shares a space with the target. The Chump heals half of all bleed damage the target takes. At the Start of the Target's turn, they must make a Vit Defense. On Player Failure, they take {Basic Damage} damage and gain 1 d6 Bleed. On Player Success, the effect ends and the chump is in an adjacent location.\n[Reaction] The first time each turn, a player starts their turn in range or enters range during any turn, making a parasite attack.",B.ci,B.cJ)
B.en=new A.p8(1,"ranged")
B.Wk=new A.c9("ranged_suppressor","Suppressor","On Player Failure, on the target's next turn, half their speed and they cannot retreat. On player success, they are slowed by 1 and cannot retreat.",B.en,B.dK)
B.VD=new A.c9("ranged_disabler","Disabler","On Player Failure, the target is disabled during their next turn.\n[Reaction] When a player ends their turn in range 6, Make the Disabler attack.",B.en,B.dK)
B.W9=new A.c9("ranged_jammer","Jammer","On Player Failure, enemies within 6 of the unit have -1 to all dice checks. On player success when in the short range, the target has -1 to all dice checks",B.en,B.dK)
