B.VV=new A.c9("ranged_mind_control","Mind Control","On Player Failure, deal half damage and the target is mind controlled. On their next turn, they must attack one of their allies using one of their features.\n[Reaction] When an ally range 6 succeeds in an attack, make the target make a Wis Defense. On Player Failure, the target is mind controlled.",B.en,B.dK)
