B.Wn=new A.c9("ranged_aoe","AOE","Instead target a {Level/3} space radius.\n[Reaction] At the end of the round, make an attack.",B.en,B.cJ)
B.Wc=new A.c9("ranged_poisoner","Poisoner","On Player Failure, They must make a Vit Defense with disadvantage. On Player Failure, they take {Level d12} damage.\n[Reaction] When an ally range 1 succeeds on an attack, cause the targets to make a Vit Defense with disadvantage. On Player Failure, they take {Level d12} extra damage.",B.en,B.cJ)
B.W8=new A.c9("ranged_burn","Burn","On Player Failure, they gain {Half Level} d6 Burn.\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts or becomes range 1, give the chump and all characters range 1 {Half Level} d6 burn.",B.en,B.cJ)
B.VE=new A.c9("ranged_sacrifice","Sacrifice","On Player Failure, They gain {Half Level} d6 Bleed.\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts or becomes range 1, Give the chump up to {Level} d6 bleed and give an enemy the same amount.",B.en,B.cJ)
