B.VW=new A.c9("healer_paramedic","Paramedic","On Failure, heal the target for Half. On Success, end all bleed, burn, and cold.\n[Reaction] When an ally starts or becomes adjacent, end all bleed, burn, and cold.",B.iN,B.hG)
