B.a3Y=new A.aC("feature_tower","Tower","[Action] Create a Wall as if you had used a skill. As long as the wall remains, you and your allies may enter the wall, and gain a {half Source} bonus to range while inside. Creatures inside may not be targeted by attacks from enemies within {Half Source} of the tower, but such enemies can still attack the tower itself. When the tower is destroyed, creatures inside must make a Dex defense or fall prone.\n\n[Reaction] After you succeed on a Melee Attack, spend your reaction and Trap one of the targets in a Tower that is a wall created as if you had used a skill. The target is restrained as long as the tower remains, cannot use reactions, and cannot target anything but the tower and has disadvantage on attacks against the tower.",B.aN,B.aje,!1,B.aoL,!0,null,null,B.L)
