B.a4L=new A.aC("feature_thorns","Thorns","[Action] Target a creature range 1. As long as you are concentrating, the target gains Resistance to damage from Melee Attacks. When the target succeeds on a defense caused by a Melee Attack, deal {Half Source d8} damage vs Wis to the attacker. While concentrating, if you activate the ability again, you may add the new targets to your current concentration.\n\n[Reaction] During your turn, spend your reaction and trigger your thorns action.\n\n[Reaction] After an ally Succeeds on a Defense from a Melee Attack, spend your reaction and deal {half Source d8} damage vs Wis.",B.aN,B.ahW,!1,B.f_,!0,null,null,B.L)
