B.a4c=new A.aC("feature_throw","Throw","[Action: 1 Unarmed]: Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an enemy within 1, who is no more than 1 size bigger than you: On a Success, you may throw them to a free space within {2*Source} of you and deal {Source d6} Damage. When you throw an ally, they may make a Finesse to ignore the damage, otherwise they take half damage.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed a defense against a melee attack, or an ally succeeds a defense against an enemy who is range 1 of you, spend your reaction, and if the target is no more than 1 size larger than you, dash them into a free space within {2*Source} and deal {Half Source d6} damage vs Str.",B.N,B.akD,!1,B.C5,!0,null,null,B.L)
