B.a_b=new A.J("feature_tribal_elder_Teacher","Teacher","Allies within {Half Source} of you gain +1 to Coordinated Aid Status Checks. After you use Coordinate Aid, Until the start of your next turn, allies range {Source} of you may spend their [Reaction] during their turn or any allies turn to Target 1 ally range 1 and make a status check. On Success, they heal the target {Targets vitality d6} or give the target the same amount of shield. They may target themselves, but must make the check with disadvantage.")
