B.aPa=new A.bI("weapon_ranged_shotgun","ShotGun",B.bt,"Being adjacent to enemies does not give you disadvantage with Shotgun, but allies provide cover to enemies. When the target is at short range, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.","3 / 6","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
B.aP7=new A.bI("weapon_ranged_rifle","Rifle",B.bt,"On Success, If you haven't moved or dashed this turn, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.","10 / 20","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
